# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to share your Python version with the colleagues or User
#   but for an application, you might want to pin it.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different OS, it might cause issues.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   poetry.lock is usually committed to version control.
#   https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file-to-version-control
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   pdm.lock is usually committed to version control.
#   https://pdm-project.org/en/latest/usage/project/#lock-file
# pdm.lock

